### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "yosi", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Login (cookie auth_token tersimpan otomatis oleh REST Client)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "yosi", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Tambah barang
POST http://localhost:8080/barang
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nama": "Indomie", "harga": 2000 }

### Daftar barang
GET http://localhost:8080/barang

### Ubah barang
PUT http://localhost:8080/barang?id=1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nama": "Indomie Goreng", "harga": 3000 }

### Hapus barang
DELETE http://localhost:8080/barang?id=1

### Pemasukan manual
POST http://localhost:8080/transaksi
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipe": "pemasukan", "jumlah": 100000, "keterangan": "Gaji" }

### Pengeluaran dari barang (jumlah = harga x qty, dihitung server)
POST http://localhost:8080/transaksi
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipe": "pengeluaran", "barang_id": 1, "qty": 2 }

### Riwayat (opsional ?tipe=pemasukan|pengeluaran)
GET http://localhost:8080/transaksi

### Hapus transaksi
DELETE http://localhost:8080/transaksi?id=1

### Ringkasan saldo
GET http://localhost:8080/ringkasan

### Buat API token (butuh login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/token/create
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nama_token": "skrip-cron", "masa_berlaku_hari": 30 }

### Pakai API token (ganti dengan token hasil di atas)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ringkasan
X-API-KEY: GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN
